@Haroenv Yes but they would just implement their `itemComponent` like `<a href={item.url}>`. 
`getURL` is really only useful if we had a default component for custom indices that renders anchors. Maybe we should ?
In any case I can't see a scenario for `getQuery` apart from query suggestions which we already handle.

